      SEND_MEMBERS COMMENT $$발송수(명) (#85)$$,
      SUCCESS_MEMBERS COMMENT $$성공수(명) (#86)$$,
      FAIL_MEMBERS COMMENT $$실패수(명) (#87)$$,
